    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-n-armband_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「すさまじく迷惑なひとですね……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「あのひとが、しばらく隠居して大人しくしていてくれたのは君咲学院にとって幸運でした」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「『選別の儀』ですか……。そういえば、下駄箱に腕章が入っておりましたね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「見覚えがなかったので、誰かがまちがえて入れたのかと思って……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「生徒会の遺失物集積用の段ボールに、放りこんでしまいましたが」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「後で、取りに行きましょう。どんな馬鹿げた勝負であろうが、わたしは譲る気はありません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「むしろ、清々した気分です」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「生徒会長という立場を、責任ある役職を、ただ受け継ぐだけ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「というのも、悔しいですがたしかに不安でした」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「もっと他に相応しいものがいるのでは、自分なんかが生徒会長でいいのだろうか……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「などと、いつまでも悩んでいたと思います」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「けれど。この『選別の儀』で勝利すれば、誰に憚ることなくそう名乗れる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「これはそういう勝負です、儀式です、天下分け目の決戦です」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「褌を締めて、臨もうと思います」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
